OL,3,GNEWSAApology as cuts to 10 young
OL,4,Acarers' youth clubs scrapped
OL,5,
OL,6,FA councillor says she feels "appalled"
OL,7,Fthat an overturned motion to cut youth
OL,8,Fclub services for young carers caused
OL,9,Fdistress to families.
OL,11,FThe proposal would have seen funding
OL,12,Fcut for 10 youth clubs from April to
OL,13,Fsave #185,000, as part of ongoing
OL,14,Fefforts to prevent Somerset Council
OL,15,Fgoing bankrupt.
OL,17,FBut at a meeting on Wednesday, the
OL,18,Fdecision to cease both the Young Carers
OL,19,Fin Schools (YCIS) programme and the
OL,20,FYoung Carers Clubs scheme was thrown
OL,21,Fout.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
