OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSAApology as cuts to 10 young
OL,4,Acarers' youth clubs scrapped
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Heather Shearer, lead member
OL,7,Ffor children, families and education,
OL,8,Fapologised for the stress caused to
OL,9,Ffamilies and said she felt "appalled"
OL,10,Ffamilies had had to witness the public
OL,11,Fdebate.
